WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:03.670
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.753 --> 00:05.046
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.130 --> 00:06.339
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.423 --> 00:08.800
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.883 --> 00:11.428
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.511 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.598
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.682 --> 00:17.600
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.684 --> 00:19.310
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.394 --> 00:21.771
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.855 --> 00:23.314
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.398 --> 00:24.357
Captain: ♪ Then drop
on the deck ♪
队长：♪ 那么就放下吧
甲板上♪

00:24.441 --> 00:25.525
♪ And flop like a fish ♪
♪ 然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 ♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.943
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.026 --> 00:28.111
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.194 --> 00:29.946
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:30.029 --> 00:32.031
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:32.115 --> 00:33.533
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.616 --> 00:37.370
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:55.305 --> 00:59.517
SpongeBob: ♪ Someday I'm gonna
make you my sweetie ♪
海绵宝宝：♪ 总有一天我会
让你成为我的甜心♪

00:59.601 --> 01:03.438
♪ Not overtly,
but sur-rep-titious-ly ♪
♪ 不公开地，
但过分重复 ♪

01:03.521 --> 01:04.981
Drum solo!
鼓独奏！

01:05.064 --> 01:08.151
Dooga, dooga, dooga, dooga,
dooga, dooga, dooga... Doo.
杜加，杜加，杜加，杜加，
杜加，杜加，杜加……杜。

01:08.234 --> 01:10.612
Doo-doo, doo, doo-doo,
doo, doo, doo.
嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，
嘟，嘟，嘟。

01:10.695 --> 01:11.946
Doo, doo.
嘟，嘟。

01:12.030 --> 01:16.159
Hey, looks like you guys
and gals are done.
嘿，看起来像你们
女孩们完成了。

01:32.300 --> 01:33.760
In all my years
of fry cookery,
在我所有的岁月里
炒菜的烹调方法，

01:33.843 --> 01:36.971
I have never seen such
a lovely group of patties.
我从未见过这样的
一群可爱的肉饼。

01:37.055 --> 01:41.684
Especially... you.
尤其是……你。

01:41.768 --> 01:42.936
Such perfection
如此完美

01:43.019 --> 01:44.020
from your little lettuce hair
来自你的小生菜头发

01:44.103 --> 01:45.438
to your rosy ketchup cheeks
到你红润的番茄酱脸颊

01:45.522 --> 01:47.440
right down
to your mustard smile.
右下
给你芥末般的微笑。

01:47.524 --> 01:49.275
May I call you... Patty?
我可以叫你……帕蒂吗？

01:49.359 --> 01:51.611
SpongeBob, I need
that order of six.
海绵宝宝，我需要
六个的顺序。

01:51.694 --> 01:52.946
Here you go, Squidward.
给你，章鱼哥。

01:53.029 --> 01:54.489
One, and two, and three
一、二、三

01:54.572 --> 01:56.699
and four, and, uh...
还有四个，还有，呃...

01:56.783 --> 01:58.076
five and six.
五和六。

01:58.159 --> 01:59.744
That's it, that's the whole
order, Squidward.
就是这样，这就是全部
命令，章鱼哥。

01:59.828 --> 02:03.289
There isn't a Krabby Patty
behind my back or anything.
没有蟹肉饼
在我背后或其他什么地方。

02:04.165 --> 02:06.835
Uh... Yeah.
呃...是的。

02:06.918 --> 02:08.795
Oh, Patty, a patty like you
哦，帕蒂，像你一样的帕蒂

02:08.878 --> 02:10.588
comes around
once in a lifetime.
来了
一生一次。

02:10.672 --> 02:11.965
I can't let them eat you.
我不能让他们吃掉你。

02:12.048 --> 02:14.175
No, the job must come first.
不，工作必须是第一位的。

02:14.259 --> 02:16.803
I can't let emotions
cloud my commitment
我不能让情绪
云我的承诺

02:16.886 --> 02:18.513
to the sacred fry cook oath.
向神圣的煎锅誓言。

02:18.596 --> 02:21.683
"That which is fried,
must be eaten."
“油炸的东西，
必须吃。”

02:21.766 --> 02:23.810
SpongeBob,
where is that other...
海绵宝宝，
另一个在哪里...

02:23.893 --> 02:25.937
Oh, there it is.
哦，就在那里。

02:31.734 --> 02:32.819
Ohh!
哦！

02:32.902 --> 02:34.988
Where's  my  Krabby Patty?
我的蟹黄饼在哪里？

02:35.071 --> 02:36.948
Right here, muscle boy.
就在这里，肌肉男孩。

02:37.031 --> 02:39.367
It's about time.
是时候了。

02:43.246 --> 02:45.290
I won't let you
do this to Patty.
我不会让你
对帕蒂这样做。

02:45.373 --> 02:47.458
SpongeBob, hand over
the Krabby...
海绵宝宝，交出手来
克拉比...

02:47.542 --> 02:50.003
SpongeBob: Oh, Patty,
I can't let them eat you.
海绵宝宝：哦，帕蒂，
我不能让他们吃掉你。

02:50.086 --> 02:52.881
Your beauty must be preserved.
你的美丽必须被保留。

02:52.964 --> 02:55.592
Amazing.
惊人的。

02:56.926 --> 02:59.095
What are you gonna
do with it, take it home?
你要做什么
处理它，把它带回家吗？

02:59.178 --> 03:00.680
Put a little dress on her?
给她穿件小裙子？

03:00.763 --> 03:03.349
Go out for a romantic
walk with it?
出去浪漫一下
与它同行？

03:03.433 --> 03:05.351
Great idea.
好主意。

03:07.061 --> 03:09.689
I wonder if it's too late to
get a refund from my therapist.
我想知道现在是否太晚了
从我的治疗师那里获得退款。

03:09.772 --> 03:10.857
Enjoy, sir.
享受吧，先生。

03:10.940 --> 03:13.359
Can I eat this one?
我可以吃这个吗？

03:13.443 --> 03:14.819
What...
什么...

03:14.903 --> 03:16.029
Hey, how'd they know?
嘿，他们怎么知道？

03:16.112 --> 03:18.615
I love grilled shoe.
我喜欢烤鞋。

03:20.950 --> 03:22.869
What's cooking there, Patty?
帕蒂，那里煮什么？

03:22.952 --> 03:24.537
Oh, are you kidding?
哦，你在开玩笑吗？

03:24.621 --> 03:25.830
I love crepes.
我喜欢薄饼。

03:25.914 --> 03:26.831
Oh, Patty...
哦，帕蒂……

03:26.915 --> 03:28.207
When we're together
当我们在一起的时候

03:28.291 --> 03:29.375
I feel like we're in
our own little world.
我感觉我们就像在
我们自己的小世界。

03:29.459 --> 03:30.877
Like...
喜欢...

03:30.960 --> 03:32.921
Like nothing
can hurt us.
好像什么都没有
会伤害我们。

03:33.004 --> 03:34.839
Fire!
火！

03:34.923 --> 03:36.799
Fire, fire.
火，火。

03:43.640 --> 03:45.934
It's OK, Patty,
the fire's gone.
没关系，帕蒂，
火已经灭了。

03:46.017 --> 03:47.018
You're safe now.
你现在安全了。

03:49.020 --> 03:51.731
Oh, I better, uh...
Get the doorbell.
哦，我更好，呃...
按门铃。

03:55.526 --> 03:56.402
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

03:56.486 --> 03:59.489
how about another game of...
再来一场游戏怎么样...

03:59.572 --> 04:03.451
tie your best buddy in knots.
把你最好的朋友打结。

04:03.534 --> 04:04.619
My turn.
轮到我了。

04:04.702 --> 04:06.496
Sorry, Patrick...
对不起，帕特里克...

04:06.579 --> 04:09.749
I already made plans to go for
a walk through Jellyfish Fields
我已经计划去
漫步水母田

04:09.832 --> 04:10.917
with Patty.
和帕蒂。

04:11.000 --> 04:12.168
As soon as the little lady
只要小女人

04:12.251 --> 04:13.962
dries her hair,
we're heading out.
擦干她的头发，
我们要出发了。

04:14.045 --> 04:15.588
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

04:16.714 --> 04:17.715
Hey, ya, SpongeBob.
嘿，是的，海绵宝宝。

04:17.799 --> 04:18.758
You didn't forget
about our plan
你没有忘记
关于我们的计划

04:18.841 --> 04:19.884
to go a-choppin', did ya?
去切菜，是吗？

04:19.968 --> 04:21.094
Sorry, Sandy.
对不起，桑迪。

04:21.177 --> 04:22.720
No time for karate today.
今天没时间练空手道。

04:22.804 --> 04:25.723
After our walk, I'm going for
a rowboat ride with Patty.
散步结束后，我要去
和帕蒂一起划船。

04:25.807 --> 04:27.433
Just waiting for her
to put on her makeup.
只等她
化妆。

04:27.517 --> 04:30.687
You know how long it takes a
Krabby Patty to get ready.
你知道需要多长时间
克拉比帕蒂做好准备。

04:30.770 --> 04:33.564
Well, that makes about
as much sense as
a snake with no slither.
嗯，这使得
一样有意义
没有滑行器的蛇

04:33.648 --> 04:36.234
Patties are put in the water
for eatin', SpongeBob.
馅饼放入水中
为了吃饭，海绵宝宝。

04:36.317 --> 04:39.070
Not for beboppin' all
over Timbuktu.
不是为了一切
廷巴克图上空。

04:39.153 --> 04:40.405
Patty.
帕蒂。

04:40.488 --> 04:42.949
Yeah, well, you two
have fun with that.
是的，好吧，你们两个
玩得开心。

04:43.032 --> 04:45.618
Patty and I have
to be on our way.
帕蒂和我有
就在路上。

04:45.702 --> 04:47.120
I've been replaced
我已经被替换了

04:47.203 --> 04:49.998
by a sandwich!
一个三明治！

04:53.918 --> 04:57.797
Maybe I could meet
a lovely sandwich of my own.
也许我可以遇见
我自己做的一个可爱的三明治。

04:57.880 --> 05:01.718
Yeah, that'll show SpongeBob.
是的，那会显示海绵宝宝。

05:11.060 --> 05:13.896
♪ Oh, baby ♪
♪ 哦，宝贝 ♪

05:13.980 --> 05:16.065
♪ They may call me a fool ♪
♪ 他们可能会称我为傻瓜 ♪

05:19.152 --> 05:21.237
♪ But I can't help ♪
♪ 但我无能为力 ♪

05:21.320 --> 05:24.532
♪ Our gravitational pull ♪
♪ 我们的引力 ♪

05:26.576 --> 05:30.038
♪ When I stuff you
with cotton candy ♪
♪ 当我给你塞东西的时候
配上棉花糖♪

05:30.121 --> 05:34.125
♪ It reminds me
you're so sweet ♪
♪ 这让我想起了
你真可爱♪

05:34.208 --> 05:37.545
♪ When we go riding,
it's dandy ♪
♪ 当我们去骑马时
真是花花公子♪

05:37.628 --> 05:39.797
♪ The way you hang on
to that seat ♪
♪ 你坚持的方式
到那个座位♪

05:39.881 --> 05:41.549
♪ Ba-ay-ay-by... ♪
♪ 拜拜拜...♪

05:41.632 --> 05:42.884
♪ When I'm with you ♪
♪ 当我和你在一起时 ♪

05:42.967 --> 05:44.927
♪ Our love is
stronger than glue ♪
♪ 我们的爱是
比胶水还坚固♪

05:46.095 --> 05:47.889
♪ Whoa ♪
♪ 哇 ♪

05:47.972 --> 05:49.182
♪ Oh, baby! ♪
♪ 哦，宝贝！ ♪

05:49.265 --> 05:50.683
♪ There isn't anything ♪
♪ 什么都没有 ♪

05:50.767 --> 05:53.936
♪ There's nothing in the world,
I wouldn't do ♪
♪ 世界上没有什么，
我不会做♪

05:54.020 --> 05:55.938
♪ For you... ♪
♪ 为你... ♪

05:56.022 --> 05:57.065
Hey.
嘿。

05:57.148 --> 05:58.941
Let go of her,
you patty-eaters.
放开她，
你们这些吃肉饼的人。

05:59.025 --> 06:00.860
No, get away!
不，走开！

06:00.943 --> 06:02.070
♪ Hi-yah! ♪
♪ 嗨呀！ ♪

06:02.153 --> 06:03.362
♪ Hi-yah! ♪
♪ 嗨呀！ ♪

06:03.446 --> 06:04.822
♪ Whoa... ♪
♪ 哇...♪

06:04.906 --> 06:05.865
♪ Yah ♪
♪ 嗯 ♪

06:05.948 --> 06:06.949
♪ Hi-yah ♪
♪ 嗨 ♪

06:07.033 --> 06:08.326
♪ Hi-yah, yah ♪
♪ 嗨呀，呀 ♪

06:08.409 --> 06:10.703
♪ Wha, cha,
ja-ja-bah ♪
♪ 哇，查，
哈-哈-巴 ♪

06:10.787 --> 06:11.996
♪ Cha, wah, wah,
wah-ba-wah ♪
♪ 嚯，哇，哇，
哇巴哇♪

06:12.080 --> 06:13.122
♪ Yah, yah ♪
♪ 是的，是的 ♪

06:13.206 --> 06:15.625
♪ Hi-yah-yah-yah-yah-yah... ♪
♪ 嗨呀呀呀呀呀呀... ♪

06:15.708 --> 06:18.920
♪ Patty, you OK, sweetums? ♪
♪ 帕蒂，你还好吗，甜心？ ♪

06:19.003 --> 06:22.423
♪ I'm so... Sorry ♪
♪ 我很...抱歉 ♪

06:22.507 --> 06:26.135
♪ I'll never let you
out of my sight again ♪
♪ 我永远不会让你
再次离开我的视线♪

06:26.219 --> 06:27.887
♪ And I'll always keep you ♪
♪ 我会永远守护你 ♪

06:27.970 --> 06:32.058
♪ Out of harm's way... ♪
♪ 远离伤害... ♪

06:32.141 --> 06:34.894
♪ Yeah... ♪
♪ 是的... ♪

06:34.977 --> 06:36.896
♪ Oh, baby ♪
♪ 哦，宝贝 ♪

06:36.979 --> 06:38.272
♪ Our love is so strong ♪
♪ 我们的爱如此强烈 ♪

06:38.356 --> 06:41.067
♪ That's why
I'm singing this song ♪
♪ 这就是为什么
我正在唱这首歌♪

06:41.150 --> 06:43.528
♪ Ba-ay-ay-by! ♪
♪ 拜拜拜！ ♪

06:43.611 --> 06:46.405
♪ Your looks
are sweeter than honey ♪
♪ 你的样子
比蜂蜜还甜♪

06:46.489 --> 06:48.116
♪ From your pickles
to your buns ♪
♪ 来自你的泡菜
到你的面包♪

06:48.199 --> 06:50.993
♪ It ain't even funny ♪
♪ 这一点都不好笑 ♪

06:51.077 --> 06:53.246
♪ Whoa... ♪
♪ 哇...♪

06:53.329 --> 06:55.748
I'm coming for you.
我来找你了

06:55.832 --> 06:56.958
Oh, no.
哦，不。

06:57.041 --> 06:58.918
Look at you.
看看你。

06:59.001 --> 06:59.961
Don't worry, Patty.
别担心，帕蒂。

07:00.044 --> 07:02.171
I'll take care of this.
我会处理这件事。

07:02.255 --> 07:04.799
There you go.
就这样吧。

07:04.882 --> 07:08.094
♪ All better ♪
♪ 一切都好起来 ♪

07:08.177 --> 07:11.180
♪ Oh, baby. ♪
♪ 哦，宝贝。 ♪

07:13.307 --> 07:14.559
Oh, Patty.
哦，帕蒂。

07:14.642 --> 07:18.146
Do you realize
what this signifies?
你意识到吗
这意味着什么？

07:18.229 --> 07:20.273
Mmm-hmm, that's right.
嗯嗯，没错。

07:20.356 --> 07:22.233
It's our six-hour anniversary.
这是我们的六小时纪念日。

07:22.316 --> 07:24.277
And do you know
what that means?
你知道吗
这意味着什么？

07:24.360 --> 07:25.945
Are you all right, Patty?
你还好吗，帕蒂？

07:26.028 --> 07:27.238
You don't seem so hot.
你看起来没那么热。

07:27.321 --> 07:28.614
Don't fret.
别担心。

07:28.698 --> 07:30.116
I know what'll
make  you  feel better.
我知道会发生什么
让你感觉更好。

07:30.199 --> 07:34.287
A dinner at the finest
restaurant in Bikini Bottom.
一顿最精致的晚餐
比基尼堡的餐厅。

07:34.370 --> 07:36.330
Mr. Krabs: Squidward!
蟹老板：章鱼哥！

07:36.414 --> 07:38.124
Where the barnacles
is our fry cook?
藤壶在哪里
是我们的炒菜厨师吗？

07:38.207 --> 07:39.333
He's been gone all day.
他已经走了一整天了。

07:39.417 --> 07:40.918
That boy's never
been a work shirker.
那个男孩从来没有
曾经是一个逃避工作的人。

07:41.002 --> 07:43.963
We got a crowd of hungry
customers waiting.
我们有一群饥饿的人
等待的顾客。

07:44.046 --> 07:45.131
How should I know?
我怎么知道？

07:45.214 --> 07:46.966
Do I look like
an idiot's keeper?
我看起来像吗
白痴的守护者？

07:47.049 --> 07:48.968
Well... Actually...
嗯……其实……

07:50.052 --> 07:52.138
Well, good day, sirs.
嗯，美好的一天，先生们。

07:52.221 --> 07:53.431
As if on cue.
就好像在暗示一样。

07:53.514 --> 07:55.474
SpongeBob, what's
with the fancy getup?
海绵宝宝，什么
与花哨的装扮？

07:55.558 --> 07:59.812
Oh, I just got gussied up
for my special dinner date.
哦，我刚刚打扮得漂漂亮亮的
为了我特别的晚餐约会。

07:59.896 --> 08:01.063
A dinner date?
晚餐约会？

08:01.147 --> 08:02.815
Well, blow me down, boy.
好吧，把我打倒吧，孩子。

08:02.899 --> 08:04.400
I didn't know you
had it in you.
我不认识你
你身上有它。

08:04.483 --> 08:06.319
So when do we get to
meet the little lady?
那么我们什么时候才能到达
遇见小女人了吗？

08:06.402 --> 08:08.154
: By the way,
is she rich?
: 顺便说一下，
她有钱吗？

08:08.237 --> 08:09.655
She's rich in taste.
她的品味很丰富。

08:09.739 --> 08:13.326
How could  you
possibly date anyone?
你怎么可以
可能和任何人约会吗？

08:13.409 --> 08:14.869
I mean, look at you.
我的意思是，看看你。

08:14.952 --> 08:16.287
She must be blind.
她一定是瞎了。

08:16.370 --> 08:18.206
Mr. Krabs: Ooh, a limousine.
蟹老板：哦，一辆豪华轿车。

08:18.289 --> 08:20.249
Oh, there she is.
哦，她在那儿。

08:20.333 --> 08:23.669
Oh, I can just smell
the money already.
哦，我只能闻到
钱已经到了。

08:26.339 --> 08:27.423
Here we are, darling.
我们到了，亲爱的。

08:27.506 --> 08:30.092
The best eatery in town.
镇上最好的餐馆。

08:34.055 --> 08:36.265
Harold, again?
又是哈罗德？

08:36.349 --> 08:37.975
Martha, I know
what you're thinking.
玛莎，我知道
你在想什么。

08:38.059 --> 08:39.352
It is not me this time.
这次不是我。

08:39.435 --> 08:42.021
Well, whatever it is,
it's disgusting.
嗯，不管是什么，
真恶心。

08:42.104 --> 08:44.232
Let's get out of here.
我们离开这里吧。

08:44.315 --> 08:45.650
Mr. Krabs, Squidward.
蟹老板，章鱼哥。

08:45.733 --> 08:47.693
Allow me to introduce
my date...
请允许我介绍一下
我的约会对象...

08:47.777 --> 08:48.694
Patty.
帕蒂。

08:48.778 --> 08:50.905
Your date's a  Krabby  Patty?
你的约会对象是蟹黄派吗？

08:50.988 --> 08:54.033
Methinks the boy's
really lost it.
我认为男孩的
真的失去了。

08:56.077 --> 08:57.536
What is that putrid odor?
那股腐臭味是什么？

08:57.620 --> 09:01.540
: Oh, it's
the Krabby Patty.
: 噢，是这样
蟹肉饼。

09:01.624 --> 09:03.584
What are you doin' with that
rotten piece o' meat, boy?.
你用那个做什么
一块烂肉，孩子？

09:03.668 --> 09:06.837
This isn't a piece O' meat,
Mr. Krabs.
这不是一块肉，
蟹老板。

09:06.921 --> 09:08.047
She's Patty.
她是帕蒂。

09:08.130 --> 09:10.007
: And we're on
a special date tonight
: 然后我们就开始了
今晚有一个特别的约会

09:10.091 --> 09:13.302
so you don't mind if we get the
"manager's treatment," do you?
所以你不介意我们得到
“经理的待遇”，你呢？

09:13.386 --> 09:15.012
Sorry boy, no can do.
对不起，孩子，我无能为力。

09:15.096 --> 09:16.305
Oh, really?
哦真的吗？

09:16.389 --> 09:18.933
Mr. Fiver says different.
菲弗先生的说法不同。

09:19.016 --> 09:20.142
What was that?
那是什么？

09:20.226 --> 09:21.143
I couldn't hear ya.
我听不到你的声音。

09:21.227 --> 09:22.395
How 'bout now?
现在怎么样？

09:22.478 --> 09:23.771
All right, take a seat.
好吧，坐下吧。

09:23.854 --> 09:25.356
Grazie.
谢谢。

09:25.439 --> 09:26.440
Here you go, my dear.
给你，亲爱的。

09:26.524 --> 09:29.360
A throne befitting a queen.
适合女王的王座。

09:29.443 --> 09:30.987
Oh, good evening,  monsieur.
噢，晚上好，先生。

09:31.070 --> 09:34.323
What might we have on the menu
at this fine establishment?
我们的菜单上可能有什么
在这家精致的酒店？

09:34.407 --> 09:36.075
Well, you should know
嗯，你应该知道

09:36.158 --> 09:39.537
considering the fact that you
work  here, sod for brains.
考虑到你
在这里工作，用草皮换大脑。

09:39.620 --> 09:41.330
Speaking of sod...
说到草皮...

09:41.414 --> 09:43.416
Why don't you get rid
of this garbage?
你为何不摆脱
这个垃圾？

09:43.499 --> 09:44.625
It's starting to
stink up the joint.
开始了
使关节发臭。

09:44.709 --> 09:46.711
Don't say such
a thing, Squidward.
别说这样的话
有一件事，章鱼哥。

09:46.794 --> 09:49.088
Patty's just
a little sick, is all.
帕蒂只是
有点病了，仅此而已。

09:49.171 --> 09:50.298
Wight, lubbie-wubbie?
怀特，卢比比-沃比？

09:50.381 --> 09:51.966
I'll show you sick.
我会让你看病的。

09:52.049 --> 09:53.217
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

09:53.301 --> 09:54.885
What are you doing
with my beautiful Patty?
你在做什么
和我美丽的帕蒂？

09:54.969 --> 09:56.178
Beautiful, huh?
很漂亮吧？

09:56.262 --> 09:58.931
How beautiful
do you think  this  is?
多么美丽啊
你认为这是吗？

10:02.143 --> 10:03.436
Stop it, Squidward.
住手吧，章鱼哥。

10:03.519 --> 10:05.271
Maybe  you  can't
see Patty's beauty
也许你不能
看看帕蒂的美丽

10:05.354 --> 10:08.399
but to me she's the most
gorgeous creature in the sea.
但对我来说她是最
海中美丽的生物。

10:08.482 --> 10:13.321
Well, I definitely see I can't
help the mentally atrophied.
嗯，我确实明白我不能
帮助精神萎缩的人。

10:13.404 --> 10:14.572
Good-bye, creature.
再见，生物。

10:14.655 --> 10:17.450
Pay you no mind to that,
wubbie-wubbie.
别理你，
乌比-乌比。

10:17.533 --> 10:20.161
I will always love you...
我将永远爱你...

10:21.537 --> 10:24.248
Yeah, what is that smell?
是啊，那是什么味道？

10:25.374 --> 10:27.877
Patty?
帕蒂？

10:30.046 --> 10:31.297
Ahh!
啊！

10:31.380 --> 10:33.632
What's happened to you?
你怎么了？

10:33.716 --> 10:35.509
I think I can explain, boy.
我想我可以解释一下，孩子。

10:35.593 --> 10:37.803
There was a time when
I was in love, too.
曾经有一段时间
我也曾恋爱过。

10:37.887 --> 10:42.808
She was a Krabby Patty that
looked a lot like yours does.
她是蟹黄派
看起来很像你的。

10:42.892 --> 10:45.770
Well, maybe not right now,
but you know what I mean.
嗯，也许不是现在，
但你知道我的意思。

10:45.853 --> 10:48.647
She was a firm, juicy,
a warm Patty.
她是一个坚定、多汁、
一个温暖的帕蒂。

10:48.731 --> 10:52.026
And attractive- oh, she
looked good enough to eat.
而且很有吸引力——哦，她
看起来不错，可以吃。

10:52.109 --> 10:54.487
So... I did.
所以...我做到了。

10:54.570 --> 10:56.364
Do you hear what
I'm sayin' to you, boy?
你听到什么了吗
我是在对你说吗，孩子？

10:56.447 --> 10:58.324
Um, not quite, Mr. Krabs.
嗯，不完全是，蟹老板。

10:58.407 --> 11:02.745
Krabby Patties are meant
to be loved  and  eaten.
蟹肉饼的意思是
被爱和被吃。

11:02.828 --> 11:04.830
That's what they're
put in the ocean for.
他们就是这样
放入海洋中。

11:04.914 --> 11:07.458
And it looks like
yours is way past due.
它看起来像
你的已经过期了。

11:07.541 --> 11:09.085
I see now.
我现在明白了。

11:09.168 --> 11:11.545
I see what I must do.
我明白我必须做什么。

11:11.629 --> 11:14.006
Oh, Patty, my darling.
哦，帕蒂，我亲爱的。

11:14.090 --> 11:15.383
Before I do this
在我这样做之前

11:15.466 --> 11:18.469
I want you to know that
I only do it out of love.
我想让你知道
我只是出于爱才这么做。

11:25.351 --> 11:26.685
Well done, boy.
干得好，孩子。

11:26.769 --> 11:28.479
And as a reward
for your valiant effort
并作为奖励
为了你的勇敢努力

11:28.562 --> 11:30.523
I'll only charge you
25 cents for the patty.
我只会向你收费
肉饼25美分。

11:30.606 --> 11:32.525
Employee discount.
员工折扣。

11:32.608 --> 11:35.069
Can I get
a doggie bag with that?
我可以得到吗
一个小狗包？

11:50.835 --> 11:52.878
Patrick:  : Could you
pass the chips, SpongeBob?
帕特里克：：你可以吗？
把筹码传过去吧，海绵宝宝？

11:52.962 --> 11:54.422
SpongeBob: Sorry, Patrick,
we're all out.
海绵宝宝：对不起，帕特里克，
我们都出去了。

11:55.673 --> 11:56.966
Patrick: Aw, barnacles.
帕特里克：噢，藤壶。

11:57.049 --> 11:59.218
Patrick: What am I gonna
do with all this dip?
帕特里克：我要做什么
这一切怎么办？

11:59.301 --> 12:00.302
Patrick.
帕特里克.

12:01.345 --> 12:02.763
What are you two morons doing?
你们两个白痴在做什么？

12:02.847 --> 12:05.015
Waiting to watch
the sunrise... with you.
等待观看
日出……和你在一起。

12:05.099 --> 12:07.184
At 3:47 in the morning?
凌晨3点47分？

12:07.268 --> 12:07.893
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

12:07.977 --> 12:08.894
In my bedroom?
在我的卧室里？

12:08.978 --> 12:09.895
We come here every morning.
我们每天早上都来这里。

12:09.979 --> 12:11.480
You sneak into my house
你偷偷溜进我家

12:11.564 --> 12:13.607
every morning?
每天早上？

12:13.691 --> 12:14.650
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

12:15.985 --> 12:20.114
It's our favorite pastime.
这是我们最喜欢的消遣。

12:20.197 --> 12:23.159
Ah, the memories we've shared,
right in this room.
啊，我们共同的回忆，
就在这个房间里。

12:23.242 --> 12:25.244
They're all here
in this memory book.
他们都在这里
在这本记忆册里。

12:26.620 --> 12:28.080
SpongeBob: Here we are
on the 4th of July.
海绵宝宝：我们来了
7 月 4 日。

12:29.832 --> 12:31.917
SpongeBob: And Valentine's Day.
海绵宝宝：还有情人节。

12:32.001 --> 12:34.420
Oh, you looked
so cute on Easter.
哦，你看起来
复活节真可爱。

12:35.754 --> 12:37.339
What's wrong, Squidward?
怎么了，章鱼哥？

12:37.423 --> 12:40.885
Do you remember what I told you
你还记得我告诉你的话吗

12:40.968 --> 12:43.721
happens to my brain
every time I see you?
发生在我的大脑里
每次我见到你？

12:43.804 --> 12:45.181
: Story time.
: 故事时间。

12:45.264 --> 12:46.849
Can I tell it
this time, Squidward?
我可以告诉吗
这次，章鱼哥？

12:46.932 --> 12:48.142
Pretty please?
请问漂亮吗？

12:48.225 --> 12:50.311
Whenever Squidward sees us
the storm clouds
每当章鱼哥看到我们时
暴风云

12:50.394 --> 12:54.190
in his brain roll in
and a nasty storm rages.
在他的大脑中滚滚而来
一场可怕的风暴正在肆虐。

12:54.273 --> 12:56.775
So Squidward's happy gland
is forced to take shelter
所以章鱼哥的快乐腺
被迫避难

12:56.859 --> 12:58.694
in the recesses of his mind.
在他心灵深处。

12:58.777 --> 13:01.155
But the happy gland
can't find a recess deep enough
但快乐的腺体
找不到足够深的凹槽

13:01.238 --> 13:04.200
so he gets the flu and has to
stay in bed until we leave.
所以他得了流感并且不得不
留在床上直到我们离开。

13:04.283 --> 13:05.659
Ah-choo.
啊呼。

13:05.743 --> 13:08.287
And that is why I will never,
for as long as I live
这就是为什么我永远不会，
只要我还活着

13:08.370 --> 13:11.790
and throughout all time
and eternity, ever...
并贯穿始终
还有永恒、永远……

13:11.874 --> 13:14.084
French Man: Three hours later.
法国人：三个小时后。

13:14.168 --> 13:16.879
Squidward: And with every
fiber of my being, I know
章鱼哥：每一次
我知道我存在的纤维

13:16.962 --> 13:18.797
that I never want
to see you two again.
我永远不想要
再次见到你们两个。

13:18.881 --> 13:19.965
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

13:20.049 --> 13:22.468
For as long
as time shall stand.
只要
随着时间的推移。

13:22.551 --> 13:23.469
Uh, Squidward?
呃，章鱼哥？

13:23.552 --> 13:25.304
What?
什么？

13:25.387 --> 13:27.223
Both: Ohh...
两人：哦……

13:27.306 --> 13:29.725
Thanks for sharing this
moment with us, Squidward.
感谢您分享这个
和我们在一起的时刻，章鱼哥。

13:29.808 --> 13:32.853
Get out!
出去！

13:35.689 --> 13:36.857
Perfect.
完美的。

13:36.941 --> 13:40.277
Wow, that's a nice one.
哇，那真是太好了。

13:40.361 --> 13:44.406
Thanks for inviting us to
your big fence-warming party.
感谢您邀请我们参加
你的大型围篱派对。

13:45.783 --> 13:47.493
Oh, of course.
哦，当然。

13:47.576 --> 13:49.370
Come have a seat.
过来坐吧。

13:49.453 --> 13:51.789
The picnic's
about to start.
野餐的
即将开始。

13:51.872 --> 13:53.541
Oh, this is so neat.
哦，这太整洁了。

13:53.624 --> 13:57.336
I've never picnicked
on a catapult before,
have you, sponge...
我从来没有野餐过
之前在弹射器上，
有你吗，海绵...

13:59.630 --> 14:02.007
It worked.
它起作用了。

14:02.091 --> 14:04.760
Now I just turn on
the electric fence...
现在我只要打开
电围栏...

14:05.928 --> 14:06.971
Now they'll never get back in.
现在他们再也回不来了。

14:08.430 --> 14:10.307
Let's
do it again.
让我们
再做一次。

14:10.391 --> 14:11.392
Let's do
it again.
让我们来做吧
再来一次。

14:11.475 --> 14:12.518
Can we,
Squidward?
我们可以吗，
章鱼哥？

14:12.601 --> 14:13.686
What? No!
什么？不！

14:13.769 --> 14:15.646
Get out.
出去。

14:15.729 --> 14:16.647
But...
但...

14:16.730 --> 14:17.648
No!
不！

14:17.731 --> 14:18.857
You're going out this door
你要走出这扇门

14:18.941 --> 14:20.192
right...
正确的...

14:20.276 --> 14:21.485
You're not mad at us,
are you, Squidward?
你没有生我们的气
你是吗，章鱼哥？

14:21.569 --> 14:22.528
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

14:22.611 --> 14:23.529
: Squidward?
: 章鱼哥？

14:30.536 --> 14:33.706
OK, then, you look like
you need some alone time.
好吧，那么你看起来像
你需要一些独处的时间。

14:33.789 --> 14:37.418
We'll be at the petting zoo
if you need us.
我们将在宠物动物园
如果您需要我们。

14:37.501 --> 14:40.838
Squidward: Do they have
cute seahorses there?
章鱼哥：他们有吗？
那里有可爱的海马吗？

14:40.921 --> 14:42.881
Yeah, they're
pretty adorable.
是的，他们是
很可爱。

14:42.965 --> 14:44.758
And... And the little scallops
还有……还有小扇贝

14:44.842 --> 14:47.386
that nibble on your fingers
when you feed them?
轻咬你的手指
你什么时候喂它们？

14:47.469 --> 14:48.554
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

14:48.637 --> 14:49.722
Can I come?
我可以来吗？

14:50.806 --> 14:52.391
Both: Ooh...
两人：哦……

14:52.474 --> 14:53.559
Yeah!
是的！

14:53.642 --> 14:54.810
Men: ♪ Dum, dum ♪
男人：♪ 嗯，嗯 ♪

14:54.893 --> 14:56.562
♪ Dum, dum ♪
♪ 达姆，达姆 ♪

14:57.646 --> 14:59.815
♪ Dum, dum ♪
♪ 达姆，达姆 ♪

15:10.534 --> 15:12.036
Both: Good night,
Squidward.
两人：晚安，
章鱼哥。

15:12.119 --> 15:13.579
Hey, Patrick...
嘿，帕特里克...

15:13.662 --> 15:16.081
Did you notice something
different  about Squidward?
你有没有注意到什么
章鱼哥有什么不同吗？

15:16.165 --> 15:18.626
Uh... New glasses?
呃……新眼镜？

15:18.709 --> 15:20.669
No, no, I mean,
he seems... happier.
不，不，我的意思是，
他看起来……更快乐了。

15:21.795 --> 15:23.922
Good night, Bikini Bottom!
晚安，比基尼泳裤！

15:24.006 --> 15:25.758
I love you!
我爱你！

15:27.176 --> 15:31.930
He's probably happy
about his new glasses.
他大概很高兴
关于他的新眼镜。

15:34.516 --> 15:36.935
Ah, ah...
啊啊啊……

15:41.106 --> 15:42.274
Good morning, SpongeBob.
早上好，海绵宝宝。

15:42.358 --> 15:43.942
Squidward: "Honk".
章鱼哥：“按喇叭”。

15:44.026 --> 15:45.986
Squidward, what are
you doing here?
章鱼哥，什么是
你在这里做什么？

15:46.070 --> 15:47.821
You were right, SpongeBob.
你是对的，海绵宝宝。

15:47.905 --> 15:49.073
Watching the sun rise
看着太阳升起

15:49.156 --> 15:52.701
together  is  much  better.
在一起好多了。

15:54.161 --> 15:56.330
Oh yeah, I forgot,
it's the new Squidward.
哦，是的，我忘了，
这是新的章鱼哥。

15:56.413 --> 15:58.832
I guess I better
get ready for work.
我想我更好
准备工作。

16:02.336 --> 16:05.839
Boy, the new Squidward
sure is friendly.
男孩，新的章鱼哥
当然是友好的。

16:10.052 --> 16:12.846
The new Squidward
sure is helpful.
新章鱼哥
当然有帮助。

16:18.894 --> 16:21.605
Ahh... Huh?
啊……啊？

16:22.981 --> 16:26.360
The new Squidward
sure is hygienic.
新章鱼哥
当然很卫生。

16:28.445 --> 16:32.866
Boy, the new Squidward
sure is chummy.
男孩，新的章鱼哥
当然是亲密的。

16:36.954 --> 16:38.872
Ahh... This is more like it.
啊……这更像是。

16:38.956 --> 16:42.000
Just me, my grill...
只有我，我的烤架...

16:42.084 --> 16:43.794
And you, Mr. Smiley face
Krabby Patty.
还有你，笑脸先生
克拉比·帕蒂。

16:43.877 --> 16:45.087
No one can come between us.
没有人可以介入我们之间。

16:45.170 --> 16:47.172
Hello, SpongeBob.
你好，海绵宝宝。

16:47.256 --> 16:48.716
Aren't you supposed
to be out front?
你不是应该
走在前面？

16:48.799 --> 16:50.509
I wanted to help you work.
我想帮你工作。

16:50.592 --> 16:51.635
What?
什么？

16:51.719 --> 16:53.137
Oh, that's
silly talk, Squidward.
哦，那是
废话，章鱼哥。

16:53.220 --> 16:54.346
I'm chief fry cook.
我是首席油炸厨师。

16:54.430 --> 16:57.516
And we fry cook's
work  alone.
我们炒厨师的
独自工作。

16:57.599 --> 16:58.642
And, uh...
而且，呃...

16:58.726 --> 17:01.145
We're not supposed
to get distracted
我们不应该
分散注意力

17:01.228 --> 17:02.896
while we're cooking, Squidward.
当我们做饭的时候，章鱼哥。

17:02.980 --> 17:04.314
Mr. Krabs: Mr. Squidward!
蟹老板：章鱼哥先生！

17:04.398 --> 17:07.067
Stop distracting SpongeBob
and service the customers.
别再分散海绵宝宝的注意力
并服务客户。

17:07.151 --> 17:08.902
How are we today?
我们今天怎么样？

17:08.986 --> 17:10.195
Everything a-OK here?
这里一切都好吗？

17:10.279 --> 17:11.947
What do you mean?
你是什​​么意思？

17:12.030 --> 17:12.948
How's your meal?
你的饭菜怎么样？

17:13.031 --> 17:14.742
Anyone need tartar sauce?
有人需要塔塔酱吗？

17:14.825 --> 17:16.368
I have an idea.
我有一个主意。

17:16.452 --> 17:20.038
How 'bout a free
Krusty Krab Jr. Crew hat
for the little tyke?
免费的怎么样
Krusty Krab Jr. 圆领帽
为了小家伙？

17:20.122 --> 17:21.081
Mommy...
妈妈...

17:21.165 --> 17:22.916
I'm scared.
我很害怕。

17:23.000 --> 17:25.043
Who wants a free refill?
谁想要免费续杯？

17:25.127 --> 17:26.879
Did someone just say "free"?
有人刚刚说“免费”吗？

17:26.962 --> 17:28.797
What's the problem here?
这里有什么问题？

17:28.881 --> 17:30.215
: He, he...
: 他，他……

17:30.299 --> 17:33.427
He asked me
if I wanted tartar sauce
他问我
如果我想要塔塔酱

17:33.510 --> 17:36.930
and then he gave me a free hat.
然后他给了我一顶免费的帽子。

17:37.014 --> 17:38.807
Free!
自由的！

17:38.891 --> 17:40.058
Mr. Squidward.
章鱼哥先生。

17:40.142 --> 17:41.059
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

17:41.143 --> 17:42.227
Listen up.
听着。

17:42.311 --> 17:43.729
Me customers come here
我的顾客来这里

17:43.812 --> 17:46.315
for cheap food
and verbal abuse.
为了便宜的食物
和言语辱骂。

17:46.398 --> 17:47.775
And if you can't get it right
如果你做不好

17:47.858 --> 17:50.068
get back in the kitchen
with SpongeBob.
回到厨房
与海绵宝宝。

17:54.323 --> 17:56.241
Squidward, what are you doing?
章鱼哥，你在做什么？

17:56.325 --> 17:58.118
Mr. Krabs told me to help you.
蟹老板让我来帮助你。

17:58.202 --> 18:00.245
So I made Krabby Patties, see?
所以我做了蟹黄馅饼，明白吗？

18:03.165 --> 18:05.250
Besides, it takes
years of practice.
除此之外，还需要
多年的实践。

18:05.334 --> 18:07.044
You'd never be up to it, sorry.
你永远无法做到这一点，抱歉。

18:07.127 --> 18:09.087
SpongeBob, what are you
doing with those patties?
海绵宝宝，你是什么
那些馅饼怎么办？

18:09.171 --> 18:10.881
Oh, these are
no good, Mr. Krabs.
哦，这些是
不好，蟹老板。

18:10.964 --> 18:11.882
Squidward made them.
章鱼哥创造了它们。

18:11.965 --> 18:12.966
They look OK to me.
他们对我来说看起来不错。

18:13.050 --> 18:14.843
But he's not a real fry cook.
但他并不是真正的炒菜厨师。

18:14.927 --> 18:16.095
He is now.
他现在就是了。

18:16.178 --> 18:17.763
Give him an apron
and put him to work.
给他一条围裙
并让他去工作。

18:17.846 --> 18:20.182
Mr. Krabs: You know, he might
be as good a fry cook as you.
蟹老板：你知道，他可能
和你一样成为一名出色的油炸厨师。

18:25.187 --> 18:26.605
Wow, SpongeBob.
哇，海绵宝宝。

18:26.688 --> 18:29.608
You've been employee of the
month a gazillion times.
你曾是以下公司的雇员
一个月无数次。

18:29.691 --> 18:32.277
I wish I could be
employee of the month.
我希望我能成为
本月最佳员工。

18:32.361 --> 18:34.780
Actually Squidward,
in point of fact
其实章鱼哥
事实上

18:34.863 --> 18:37.866
I've been employee
of the month a gazillion
and six times  .
我当过员工
本月数百万
和六次。

18:37.950 --> 18:38.867
Keep dreamin'.
继续做梦吧

18:38.951 --> 18:40.035
Mr. Krabs: SpongeBob!
蟹老板：海绵宝宝！

18:40.118 --> 18:41.119
Yes, Mr. Krabs?
是吗，蟹老板？

18:41.203 --> 18:42.287
What is the meaning of this?
这有什么意义呢？

18:42.371 --> 18:43.789
What's wrong with it?
有什么问题吗？

18:43.872 --> 18:46.917
Mr. Krabs: A smiley face
with dimples?
蟹老板：笑脸
有酒窝？

18:48.752 --> 18:50.003
Dimples?
酒窝？

18:50.087 --> 18:51.004
It was him.
是他。

18:51.088 --> 18:52.422
New Squidward did it.
新章鱼哥做到了。

18:52.506 --> 18:54.007
Mr. Krabs: Mr. Squidward.
蟹老板：章鱼哥先生。

18:54.091 --> 18:55.342
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

18:55.425 --> 18:57.427
I have one thing
to say to you, mister...
我有一件事
对您说，先生...

18:57.511 --> 19:01.181
Oh, I just love those little
ketchup dimples you do.
哦，我就是喜欢那些小东西
你做的番茄酱酒窝。

19:01.265 --> 19:03.642
You're me new
employee of the month.
你是我的新人
本月最佳员工。

19:06.144 --> 19:07.646
Special delivery.
特别送货。

19:07.729 --> 19:11.984
For this month's
employee of the month.
对于这个月的
本月最佳员工。

19:12.067 --> 19:13.318
I wonder who it could be.
我想知道这可能是谁。

19:13.402 --> 19:16.071
As if I didn't know.
好像我不知道一样。

19:16.154 --> 19:18.031
No, really, who is it?
不，真的，那是谁？

19:18.115 --> 19:19.324
I don't know.
我不知道。

19:19.408 --> 19:22.035
The guy you're looking
for is over there.
你正在寻找的那个人
因为就在那里。

19:22.119 --> 19:24.705
All: Hooray!
全体：万岁！

19:29.251 --> 19:31.003
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

19:31.086 --> 19:33.172
I want you to pull
yourself together, OK?
我要你拉
自己在一起，好吗？

19:33.255 --> 19:35.048
And then I want you to...
然后我要你...

19:35.132 --> 19:36.258
Um-hm.
嗯嗯。

19:36.341 --> 19:38.051
Help me spell Squidward.
帮我拼写一下《章鱼哥》。

19:38.135 --> 19:39.970
OK.
好的。

19:43.432 --> 19:45.267
Thanks, SpongeBob.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

19:45.350 --> 19:47.686
Party at my house!
来我家聚会吧！

19:55.819 --> 19:59.197
Squidward: Enjoying
the party, SpongeBob?
章鱼哥：享受
派对，海绵宝宝？

20:00.574 --> 20:02.367
Squidward: How's the cake,
SpongeBob?
章鱼哥：蛋糕怎么样？
海绵宝宝？

20:02.451 --> 20:04.244
It's OK, Squidward.
没关系，章鱼哥。

20:04.328 --> 20:06.163
It's a very
OK cake.
这是一个非常
好的蛋糕。

20:06.246 --> 20:09.249
Squidward: I love being
employee of the month.
章鱼哥：我喜欢存在
本月最佳员工。

20:09.333 --> 20:12.961
Oh, so what if new Squidward
is a better cook than you.
哦，如果新章鱼哥又怎样
是比你更好的厨师。

20:13.045 --> 20:14.713
It doesn't matter.
没关系。

20:14.796 --> 20:17.090
And so what
if Squidward replaced you
as employee of the month.
那又怎样
如果章鱼哥取代了你
作为本月最佳员工。

20:17.174 --> 20:20.969
And so what if new Squidward
is pogo dancing
with your best friend.
如果新的章鱼哥又怎样
pogo 跳舞吗
和你最好的朋友。

20:22.304 --> 20:24.389
Pogo dancing
with your best friend?!
波戈舞
和你最好的朋友？！

20:31.063 --> 20:33.065
Ohh!
哦！

20:34.816 --> 20:35.984
Stop!
停止！

20:38.528 --> 20:41.198
Maybe you can take my job.
也许你可以接替我的工作。

20:41.281 --> 20:43.408
And maybe you can take my place
也许你可以代替我

20:43.492 --> 20:45.118
on the employee of
the month wall of fame.
关于雇员的
本月名人墙。

20:45.202 --> 20:46.244
But nobody...
但没有人...

20:46.328 --> 20:48.622
And I mean  nobody
我的意思是没有人

20:48.705 --> 20:52.250
pogo dances
with that guy but me.
波戈舞
和除了我之外的那个人。

20:52.334 --> 20:54.252
Now do yourself
a big, fat favor
现在做你自己
一个大而丰盛的恩惠

20:54.336 --> 20:55.879
and get out, bub.
出去吧，小伙子。

21:09.393 --> 21:10.602
You know, Patrick
你知道，帕特里克

21:10.686 --> 21:13.563
maybe I was a little
hard on new Squidward.
也许我有点
对新章鱼哥很严厉。

21:13.647 --> 21:15.774
I mean, he might
be a good fry cook
我的意思是，他可能
做一名优秀的炒菜厨师

21:15.857 --> 21:18.151
and he might have
his picture on the wall
他可能有
墙上有他的照片

21:18.235 --> 21:22.280
but I still have the
best friend in the world.
但我还有
世界上最好的朋友。

21:22.364 --> 21:24.116
I know, I'll go apologize.
我知道了，我这就去道歉。

21:24.199 --> 21:25.534
Come on.
快点。

21:30.205 --> 21:31.957
Squidward,
I just wanna say
章鱼哥，
我只想说

21:32.040 --> 21:34.334
I'm sorry for being so selfish
and yelling at you and all.
我很抱歉我这么自私
并对你和所有人大喊大叫。

21:34.418 --> 21:35.711
I mean, who cares about cooking
我的意思是，谁关心做饭

21:35.794 --> 21:38.130
and pictures on
the wall and dancing?
和图片上
墙和跳舞？

21:38.213 --> 21:39.756
We're bigger than that, right?
我们比那更大，对吧？

21:39.840 --> 21:43.301
So if you're willing
to let bygones be bygones
所以如果你愿意的话
过去的事就让它过去吧

21:43.385 --> 21:45.137
then I'm willing
to meet you halfway.
那么我愿意
半路遇见你。

21:45.220 --> 21:47.097
What do you say, buddy?
你说什么，伙计？

21:47.180 --> 21:48.140
Put 'er there.
把她放在那里。

21:49.391 --> 21:50.976
He's too proud.
他太骄傲了。

21:51.059 --> 21:54.021
Oh, I'll just meet
you all the way.
哦，我刚好会见
你一路走好。

21:54.104 --> 21:56.231
Lay one on me, pal.
给我放一个，朋友。

21:59.526 --> 22:04.072
Hey, hey, I wanna
dance funny, too.
嘿嘿嘿我想要
跳舞也很有趣。

22:10.412 --> 22:12.414
SpongeBob, Patrick...
海绵宝宝、帕特里克...

22:12.497 --> 22:13.915
What are you two
still doing here?
你们两个是什么
还在这里做什么？

22:13.999 --> 22:16.835
:
What are you talking about?
：
你在说什么？

22:16.918 --> 22:20.464
Yeah, what's the big idea?
是啊，有什么大创意吗？

22:20.547 --> 22:23.467
I don't need
this aggravation.
我不需要
这种加重。

22:23.550 --> 22:26.428
Why are you
still standing here?
你为什么是
还站在这里吗？

你为什么是
还站在这里吗？